---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Record one of four durable correction reasons

Usage: mxr todo correct [OPTIONS] <TODO_ID> <REASON> [FIELD=VALUE]...

Arguments:
  <TODO_ID>
  <REASON>          [possible values: not-a-todo, not-mine, already-done, wrong-details]
  [FIELD=VALUE]...

Options:
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
